        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏸 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong> <strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches. Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 CAREER MODE: BUILD YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise through a full career mode, competing in the <strong>world's biggest tournaments</strong>. <strong>Train, improve, and climb a ranking</strong> system inspired by real-world competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your playstyle naturally: your skills evolve based on how you train and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends. Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you're a competitive player or a lifelong fan, it’s time to bring your skills to the digital court.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Badminton</strong> brings the speed, precision, and energy of real-world badminton to life. Experience the fastest racket sport in the world like never before, in a realistic and accessible game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏸 REALISTIC GAMEPLAY &amp; PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic shuttle physics</strong> and <strong>realistic</strong> <strong>player animations</strong> recreate the flow and intensity of real matches. Expect a challenge that feels natural, with performance shaped by positioning, timing, and shot selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/b2fbf69fd1a55a46754a0cbcff7850b8.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 CAREER MODE: BUILD YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the bottom and rise through a full career mode, competing in the <strong>world's biggest tournaments</strong>. <strong>Train, improve, and climb a ranking</strong> system inspired by real-world competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your playstyle naturally: your skills evolve based on how you train and compete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/a2b9219ca38c47a91a13fc264dfefe91.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 LOCAL MULTIPLAYER (UP TO 4 PLAYERS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play singles or doubles with your friends. Pure Badminton supports local <strong>multiplayer</strong> for <strong>up to 4 players</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.poster.avif?t=1778241954\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.webm?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2591310/extras/06ad7811fc8ec73fa9cc9fa4cb50869c.mp4?t=1778241954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whether you're a competitive player or a lifelong fan, it’s time to bring your skills to the digital court.</strong></p>",
